Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拓也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛 偷吃我的布丁了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱里面的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我有吃吗?没有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗? 我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗? 我忘了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 什么记忆力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃我的东西了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你没写名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不写就不懂吗? 你多笨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了不是你买的就不是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不要乱吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,又没关系 你都写上名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己要克制啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,又没工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,都自己一个人在家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也不去上课
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都在混
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有女友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,干麻 我看你无法结婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你没付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不要碰我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗?\N知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今天爸妈会出去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.15,0:02:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我男友会来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你也出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不要会来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你出去外面就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么态度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己又不喜欢吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很时髦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这种还好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,换一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还是日式的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我最远也有学哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在看什么\N没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 \N没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要看手机了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那干麻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,难得在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好好相处啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,放下吧 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一下子唷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了么?\N还没
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,做啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没做了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在这吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我房间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那么久没做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可是昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,工作很晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.15,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那快点就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,今天没有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啦\N做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啦\N还没好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,体息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去房间吧\N等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不去吗?\N等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 不做爱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亲我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亲我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N亲我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.13,0:06:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看什么 你快出去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快点出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,干麻啊\N过份
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想到他在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他会出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很难做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不会啦 去我房间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我也累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他又在 我先回家好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,回去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,都没做上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣 糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这种态度对我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,忍很久了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那么饥渴的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是要你出去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,害我男友回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是羡慕我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有女友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.13,0:08:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,穿这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会想要有这种男友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要说什么 讲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 笑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快点讲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还说想要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好今天...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那是跟我男友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要亲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他令天很累
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这样都被拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有 \N外遇了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都回去了 刚好令天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我没很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,被讨厌了\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很好可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很好\N真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那么快回家 只有今天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 \N他累了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐好弱哦 \N什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱很弱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一般的内衣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,叉不会做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想被你讲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我又没女友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有弱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一点是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,比一般的要弱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.13,0:10:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只是他累了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,会这么快吗?\N上班的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经几岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有不会做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去就一直单身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,之前男友很快就分手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,腻了吗?\N不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,太弱\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,干麻生气\N我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.15,0:11:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你听好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我做爱没有很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有在听吗?\N有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么态度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.16,0:11:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很弱\N什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是分手的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你有听我讲话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,干麻笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我做爱没有很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不弱啊\N是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那让我看看\N什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看 \N怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,果然弱\N不是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,男友的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你有自信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,给你看不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有关系吗?\N有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有自信的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N果然不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不该给我看\N怎么证明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我男友...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不满意才回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪有不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到吗?\N知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很厉害 听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我做爱很强的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不弱 \N知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那好啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,做得到吗?\N当然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,照平常那样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.15,0:14:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.15,0:14:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,裤子脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗? 不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不会兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那么不色情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,快点脱掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看着无法兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.15,0:14:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你要色一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这么没有魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,穿性感点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,夏天才会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不懂吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,男生都这样的吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,才刚开始/
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.15,0:16:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,上来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不性感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 刚开始而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要摸我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己弄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吗?\N吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这么安静
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,做一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N叫出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,摸自己让自己舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这么弱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会想要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.15,0:18:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么 \N穿上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,穿真个才好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我穿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要性感一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你学好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要让我看清楚\N看了没
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊 手放开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太露了\N这样才性感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,奶头跑出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,奶头硬了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,穿这兴奋吗?\N没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,手放下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不兴奋 对方怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,性感点\N知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么用啊\N就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,努力点\N我有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不然无法结婚哦\N吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 不够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,下面也要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,过来点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,打开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,摸到了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,色一点给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.16,0:22:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.16,0:22:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打开点才看得到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,打开脚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打开
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.15,0:23:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自己打开 摸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,会了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说点淫荡的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打开给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N打开来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.15,0:24:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有啊\N看错了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,讲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请看着我的小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再色一点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.14,0:24:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,色一点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,会自慰吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.14,0:25:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看\N为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.15,0:25:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才会兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.15,0:25:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.16,0:25:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了吗?\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.14,0:25:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.15,0:25:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自己展现给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.15,0:25:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 \N要会弄湿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.16,0:26:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可是\N这是重要的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,练习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.14,0:26:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.15,0:27:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.15,0:27:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自己说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去了 请看我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.14,0:27:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.14,0:27:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.15,0:27:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.16,0:27:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.16,0:27:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不用在意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.13,0:27:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.14,0:27:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那么色的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.14,0:28:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.14,0:28:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还是要继续\N什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.15,0:28:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有个东西\N什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.16,0:28:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.13,0:28:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看不懂吗?\N我懂 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.14,0:28:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,自慰给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要学习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.15,0:28:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.16,0:29:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.16,0:29:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,自己用 讲出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.14,0:29:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.14,0:29:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大声点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.14,0:29:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.15,0:29:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,用给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.14,0:30:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.14,0:30:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.15,0:30:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,后面给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.16,0:30:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要后面看吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.16,0:30:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,自已来诱惑人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.20,0:30:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.14,0:30:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,翘高给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.13,0:31:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,翘高点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.14,0:31:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要男友干你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.15,0:31:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊\N不行
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.15,0:31:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,请看我那色色的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.13,0:31:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,继续说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.14,0:31:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.13,0:32:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.14,0:32:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.15,0:32:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.15,0:32:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.16,0:32:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.13,0:32:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有个刺激的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.14,0:33:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么\N来试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.15,0:33:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.15,0:33:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,用过吗?\N没有
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.15,0:33:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来 试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.16,0:33:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,会很刺激的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.13,0:33:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好好的绑住唷
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.14,0:33:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,用了以后
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.14,0:33:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就会兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.15,0:33:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.15,0:33:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.16,0:33:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 真敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打开脚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.15,0:34:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.16,0:34:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.16,0:34:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是学习的一环
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N 不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.16,0:35:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 就说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.13,0:35:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.14,0:35:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.15,0:35:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.15,0:35:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.15,0:35:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.15,0:35:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.13,0:35:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.14,0:35:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.15,0:35:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自已舔舔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.15,0:36:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,握着 吃进去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.13,0:36:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,里面好湿唷
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.14,0:36:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.15,0:36:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,插进去唷
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.15,0:36:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.16,0:36:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.14,0:36:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.14,0:36:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.15,0:37:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.35,0:37:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,自已打开脚
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.13,0:37:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,想被插吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 拜托插我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.14,0:37:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.15,0:37:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.16,0:37:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,插我 插我小穴吧
