Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.13,1:58:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不 去了...不行
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.14,1:58:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.15,1:58:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,起来趴着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.14,1:59:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.15,1:59:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服 不
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.13,1:59:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.40,1:59:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.41,1:59:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.15,1:59:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.13,2:00:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.13,2:00:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我还想要
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.15,2:00:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.16,2:00:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.23,2:00:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.14,2:00:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害那边
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.14,2:00:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.21,2:01:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.22,2:01:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.13,2:01:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,躺着吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.16,2:01:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.13,2:01:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,插啊
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.14,2:01:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.14,2:02:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,插我 我还要
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.13,2:02:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 不行
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.41,2:02:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.15,2:02:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒 不行
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.42,2:02:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.22,2:02:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.13,2:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.14,2:03:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.15,2:03:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再来啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.15,2:03:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.13,2:03:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.20,2:03:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.20,2:03:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.14,2:03:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.15,2:03:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行那边
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.15,2:03:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,插我 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.20,2:04:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.15,2:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.22,2:04:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.13,2:04:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,去了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.13,2:04:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.14,2:04:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服 不行
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.14,2:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.21,2:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.15,2:05:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了 去了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.14,2:05:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要吧
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.14,2:05:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,继续插我
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.15,2:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.12,2:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.13,2:05:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,吹肉棒
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.14,2:05:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 好大
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.14,2:05:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.15,2:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.15,2:06:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去了 不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.13,2:06:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,射唷
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.14,2:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,槽了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.13,2:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 你还不够好唷
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.14,2:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.15,2:07:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐要继续练习才可以唷
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.13,2:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 内裤看到了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.20,2:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.14,2:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.14,2:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好累啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.15,2:07:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你进来干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.15,2:07:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 走开
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.16,2:07:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.13,2:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐...怎么了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.13,2:07:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你摸什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.13,2:07:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因为..\N不要摸我变态
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.14,2:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.14,2:08:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的房间
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.15,2:08:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的吗?\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.15,2:08:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点出去
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.15,2:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很困
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.16,2:08:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 \N姐姐 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.13,2:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一直叫 出去
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.13,2:08:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.13,2:08:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡哪\N去外面
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.14,2:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.21,2:08:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.15,2:08:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,又喝酒 好臭
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.15,2:08:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.13,2:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.13,2:09:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么资料
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.13,2:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.14,2:09:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看着这些
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.14,2:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有朋友 会有女友
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.15,2:09:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吧 这我研究的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.18,2:09:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好恶心
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.15,2:09:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,走开\N等等
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.13,2:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么脱掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.13,2:09:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.13,2:09:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.14,2:09:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得这那么臭
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.14,2:09:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你喝酒才臭
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.14,2:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.15,2:09:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你房间
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.42,2:09:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,臭的跟什么一样
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.15,2:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真变态
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.12,2:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N姐姐好难过
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.13,2:10:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的样子
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.14,2:10:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐才是
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.14,2:10:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还没结婚\N闭嘴了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.15,2:10:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样子爱喝酒才会
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.15,2:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吵 我跟男友分手了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.13,2:10:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,又分啊
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.13,2:10:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.13,2:10:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不合适
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.13,2:10:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,合适 ...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.14,2:10:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,上次也是一样的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.14,2:10:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好吵
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.21,2:11:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.15,2:11:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都一样
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.16,2:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,无法高潮
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.13,2:11:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N大家吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.13,2:11:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好怪唷
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.13,2:11:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一般会射吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.14,2:11:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会你
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.14,2:11:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.14,2:11:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱很弱吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.21,2:11:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.15,2:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.16,2:11:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗?\N你自已知道吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.13,2:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,果然\N我哪有
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.20,2:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很弱
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.20,2:11:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听你讲
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.14,2:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我很笨可是
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.15,2:12:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你做爱很弱
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.15,2:12:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪有啊
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.42,2:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真差劲
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.39,2:12:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 很弱啊
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.20,2:12:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.13,2:12:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,讲到你痛处\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.20,2:12:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很弱\N我没有
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.14,2:12:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜\N哪有
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.41,2:12:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 知道
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.15,2:12:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜 \N我不听了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.15,2:12:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,听好\N我好厉害的
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.22,2:12:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N好
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.19,2:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么态度
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.13,2:12:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有努力做
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.13,2:13:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好 \N好了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.14,2:13:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\N是吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.14,2:13:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.21,2:13:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你有在听吗?\N大概
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.21,2:13:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大概而已吧
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.42,2:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我有好好的努力
Dialogue: 0,2:13:22.22,2:13:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.13,2:13:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.20,2:13:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜 \N哪什么态度
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.13,2:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到吗?\N听到了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.14,2:13:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.15,2:13:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有在听吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.15,2:13:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好好听我讲啊
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.12,2:13:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真是
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.13,2:14:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.13,2:14:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.14,2:14:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.14,2:14:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.15,2:14:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你厉害的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.15,2:14:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,证明给我看
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.22,2:14:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.23,2:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才无法厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.13,2:14:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是家人啊
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.40,2:14:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐因为很弱 不想给我看吧
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.14,2:14:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.14,2:14:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂啦
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.14,2:14:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,果然很弱 不让我看
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.22,2:14:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那..我愿意
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.23,2:15:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.13,2:15:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.13,2:15:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你有多厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.38,2:15:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在这吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.15,2:15:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那..裤子脱掉
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.15,2:15:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐 厉害的话
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.13,2:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么要我脱掉
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.13,2:15:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你证明给我看啊
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.21,2:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不..
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.14,2:15:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这 果然不行
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.42,2:16:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.15,2:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会 \N那让我看
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.23,2:16:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.40,2:16:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么弄
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.20,2:16:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,内衣裤我看
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.15,2:16:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 好啦
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.18,2:17:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那我看看
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.15,2:17:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近点
Dialogue: 0,2:18:12.15,2:18:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,2:18:18.35,2:18:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,翘高屁股自己动动
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.14,2:18:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.15,2:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不够吧
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.12,2:18:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你的这内衣裤好土
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.13,2:19:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太普通了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.17,2:19:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,换一下
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.18,2:19:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 给你
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.19,2:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么 内衣吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.16,2:19:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不穿这样的话
Dialogue: 0,2:19:38.17,2:19:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.17,2:19:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这种..\N穿过吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.18,2:19:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么够
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.25,2:19:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,换上吧
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.16,2:20:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞什么
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.16,2:20:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
